---
args: { dossier: PayableDossier, ledger: PayableBook | null }
returns: PayableReview
---
Bind prior to the supplied ledger or a complete empty PayableBook at revision zero with empty versions, reservations, balances, payments, consumedCreditIds and consumedObservationIds. Bind versions = identifyLiabilityVersions(dossier, prior). Treat a corrected same-number invoice as a new document version of its evidenced liability; ambiguous supplier/entity references remain unresolved.

Bind priorPayments = invalidateChangedPayments(versions, prior, dossier.documents). A new verified credit or changed payable version invalidates the affected unissued instruction before further release. Preserve original service dates if a period closes; any new posting period requires its own authority. Bind lines = readInvoiceLines(dossier.documents, versions). For every line call locateReceiptLinks(line, dossier.documents, prior.reservations) and collect the returned edges as links. Build alternative many-to-many mappings without forcing text similarity into a receipt identity.

Bind partitions = partitionSupportedBalance(lines, links, versions, prior, dossier.documents). Keep accepted, held and verified credited amounts distinct. Do not turn a substituted item into accepted delivery without the receiving authority's evidence. Bind reservations = proposeReceiptReservations(links, partitions, prior). Bind instructions = prepareEntityInstructions(partitions, versions, reservations, dossier). Require the receipt allocation ledger's expected version and an independent approver. Scope each reservation to the shared legal-entity receipt ledger, not just this invoice; a stale global reservation requires recomputing the allocation.

Bind nextBook: PayableBook = { revision: advance only when liability editions, balance partitions, proposed reservations or payment instructions changed; otherwise preserve prior.revision, versions: append source-identified liability editions while preserving superseded versions, reservations: preserve actual reserved/consumed history and append only new proposed reservations by operation identity, balances: replace only the exact line/version partitions while retaining prior history, payments: merge priorPayments and new instructions by operationId without resetting sent or unknown states, consumedCreditIds: prior consumed credits plus only credits with matching authoritative consumption receipts, consumedObservationIds: prior consumed observation identities unchanged because this review supplies no posting receipt }. Bind invoiceExplanations to each line's supported, held and credited partition with its actual reason and evidence. Bind targetedQuestions to unresolved liability lineage, unreadable amount/currency, receipt-link alternatives, held balance reasons and missing approval or reservation authority. Bind blockingFacts to the precise blockers from versions, lines, links, partitions, reservations and instructions. Keep null amount components held and never sum null as zero. No payment is posted by this operation.

Return { ledger: nextBook, invoiceExplanations, targetedQuestions, instructions: nextBook.payments for the active liability versions, blockingFacts } as PayableReview.
